-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

features.h implements the tuning estimate (estimate_tuning, piptrack,
pitch_tuning) and the hybrid constant-Q transform (hybrid_cqt, pseudo_cqt,
vqt, wavelet filters, sparsify_rows), and tempo.h the tempo step of
beat_track (onset_strength with the Slaney mel filters and power_to_db, the
autocorrelation tempogram and tempo), as librosa 0.11 defines them:
https://github.com/librosa/librosa

